---
// ==============================================================================
// src/pages/privacy-policy.astro
// Privacy Policy & Cookie Disclosure
// Complies with Google AdSense, GDPR, CCPA, and Publisher Disclosure Standards
// ==============================================================================

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy & Cookie Disclosures"
  description="Read the official Privacy Policy for PakInternships, including comprehensive Google AdSense advertising cookie and analytics disclosures."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-6 mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider">
          Legal Documentation
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mt-3">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">
          Effective Date: January 1, 2026 • Last Reviewed: November 2026
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p>
          At <strong>PakInternships</strong> (accessible via <code>https://pakistan-internships.pages.dev</code>), one of our core operational priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information that is recorded and collected by PakInternships and how we use it.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">1. We Do Not Store Resumes or Private User Accounts</h2>
        <p>
          Unlike conventional recruitment platforms, PakInternships operates as an open-access, editorial directory. We do not require student registrations, we do not solicit passwords, and we do not maintain a resume or CV database. All application pathways direct candidates directly to the verified corporate recruitment servers of the hiring employers.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">2. Standard Server Log Files</h2>
        <p>
          PakInternships follows a standard procedure of utilizing log files through our infrastructure hosting provider (Cloudflare Pages). These files log visitors when they visit websites. The information collected by log files includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks. These are not linked to any personally identifiable information. The purpose of this information is for analyzing trends, administering the site, tracking users' movement on the website, and gathering demographic information to maintain optimal performance.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">3. Google AdSense & DoubleClick DART Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Google is a third-party vendor on our site. It also uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to <code>pakistan-internships.pages.dev</code> and other sites on the internet.
        </p>
        <p>
          However, visitors may choose to decline the use of DART cookies by visiting the Google ad and content network Privacy Policy at the following URL: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-700 font-semibold underline">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Some of our advertising partners may use cookies and web beacons on our site. Our advertising partners include:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600">
          <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> Primary display and responsive contextual advertising network.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          These third-party ad servers or ad networks use technology in their respective advertisements and links that appear on PakInternships, which are sent directly to users' browser. They automatically receive your IP address when this occurs. These technologies are used to measure the effectiveness of their advertising campaigns and/or to personalize the advertising content that you see on websites that you visit.
        </p>
        <p>
          Note that PakInternships has no access to or control over these cookies that are used by third-party advertisers.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">4. Third-Party Privacy Policies</h2>
        <p>
          PakInternships's Privacy Policy does not apply to other advertisers or websites. Thus, we advise you to consult the respective Privacy Policies of these third-party ad servers for more detailed information. It may include their practices and instructions about how to opt-out of certain options.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can choose to disable cookies through your individual browser options. To know more detailed information about cookie management with specific web browsers, it can be found at the browsers' respective websites.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">5. CCPA Privacy Rights (Do Not Sell My Personal Information)</h2>
        <p>
          Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), among other rights, California consumers have the right to request that a business disclose the categories and specific pieces of personal data that a business has collected about consumers. Since PakInternships does not collect, sell, or commercialize consumer personal information, we comply fully with non-sale consumer privacy mandates.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">6. GDPR Data Protection Rights</h2>
        <p>
          We want to ensure you are fully aware of all of your data protection rights. Every user is entitled to the right to access, the right to rectification, the right to erasure, the right to restrict processing, and the right to data portability. Since we do not retain identifiable personal accounts, inquiries regarding any passive log references may be directed to our editorial desk.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">7. Children's Information Protection</h2>
        <p>
          Another part of our priority is adding protection for children while using the internet. We encourage parents and guardians to observe, participate in, and/or monitor and guide their online activity. PakInternships does not knowingly collect any Personal Identifiable Information from children under the age of 13.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">8. Privacy Inquiries & Data Controller</h2>
        <p>
          If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact our appointed Data Coordinator at <code>privacy@pakistan-internships.pages.dev</code> or by post at our Lahore editorial office.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
